     depth in conjunction with the existing extension, and by reason of its siting, would be detrimental to the amenities of the
     neighbouring occupiers at No. 62 Kenilworth Avenue, contrary to Policy
     D3.D(7) of the London Plan (2021), Policy DM1 of the Development
     Management Policies Local Plan document (2013) and the relevant provisions
